{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29055","headline":"题灵山寺行坚师院 · 许浑","name":"题灵山寺行坚师院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岩一迳不通樵，八十持杯未觉遥。\n龙在石潭闻夜雨，鴈移沙渚见秋潮。\n经函露湿文多暗，香印风吹字半销。\n应笑东归又南去，越山无路水迢迢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}